    <string name="eq_global_sub">Apply this equalizer to the whole device</string>
    <string name="eq_global_notif">Equalizer active across the whole device</string>
    <string name="eq_global_help">Affects everything that plays on this device: YouTube, Spotify, videos, games… Some apps or manufacturers ignore it. It uses the system equalizer (band-based), so the curve is approximated; for maximum accuracy use normal mode.</string>
    <string name="eq_global_warn_title">Turn on the global equalizer?</string>
    <string name="eq_global_warn">It will apply to all audio on the device, in any app (YouTube, Spotify, videos…), not just Luna player.\n\nIt uses Android\'s system equalizer: the curve is approximated with its bands and some apps or manufacturers may ignore it. A notification is shown while it is active. You can turn it off at any time.</string>
